This ontology fragment defines four classes: `hpc:JobSpanningSection`, `hpc:SameResourceSection`, `hpc:ComputeUnitResourceSection`, and `hpc:AffinityResourceSection`. It also defines an object property `hpc:appliesTo` that links a `hpc:ResourceRequirementStringSection` to a `hpc:Job`.
